  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "When customers make one or more in-app purchases in your app, the App Store emails them a receipt. The receipt contains an order ID. Use this order ID to call `Look-Up-Order-ID`. Customers can also retrieve their order IDs from their purchase history on the App Store; for more information, see `https://support.apple.com/en-gb/HT204088`.",
